    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d300">

                <pb facs="0385" n="379" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg379"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Martin, consul at Nanking, to Mr.
                    Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-08-07"><hi rendition="#italic">August 7,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Sovereign rights of China being guaranteed, Viceroy willing Whangpu conservation
                    be carried out and expects inspector-general of customs to represent China.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Martin.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
